# 方法論（MANDATORY）

> 任何 breaking change、新功能、跨多檔案改動 **必須** 走這份流程。

## 完整流程圖

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    subgraph PRE[前期]
        A[User Request] --> B[brainstorming]
        B --> C[speckit-specify]
        C --> D[speckit-clarify?]
        D --> E[speckit-plan]
        E --> F[speckit-tasks]
        F --> G[speckit-analyze?]
    end
    
    subgraph BDD[BDD 行為測試]
        G --> H[抽出 .feature]
        H --> I[Step Definitions]
        I --> J[npm run test:bdd]
    end
    
    subgraph TDD[TDD 單元測試]
        G --> K[test-driven-development]
        K --> L[Failing Test]
        L --> M[Implementation]
        M --> N[npm test]
    end
    
    subgraph QA[品質把關]
        N --> O[run-smoke-tests]
        O --> P[requesting-code-review]
        P --> Q[verification-before-completion]
    end
    
    subgraph FINISH[完成]
        Q --> R[finishing-a-development-branch]
        R --> S[saome-self-improvement]
        S --> T[完成]
    end
```

## 流程說明

| 環節 | 工具/Skill | 產出 |
|------|------------|------|
| 創意發想 | `superpowers:brainstorming` | design doc |
| 需求澄清 | `speckit-specify` | spec.md |
| 技術規劃 | `speckit-plan` | plan.md, data-model.md |
| 任務分解 | `speckit-tasks` | tasks.md |
| BDD 行為 | 手動 + `002-bdd.mdc` | *.feature |
| TDD 實作 | `superpowers:test-driven-development` | *.test.tsx |
| 冒煙測試 | `superpowers:run-smoke-tests` | smoke test report |
| Code Review | `superpowers:requesting-code-review` | review report |
| 最終驗證 | `superpowers:verification-before-completion` | verification report |
| 完成分支 | `superpowers:finishing-a-development-branch` | branch merged/PR |

## 觸發時機

| 改動類型 | 必走 SDD | 必走 BDD | 必走 TDD | 必走 Review |
|----------|----------|----------|----------|-------------|
| 新功能（多檔） | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| 新功能（單檔） | ✅ | ❌ | ✅ | ✅ |
| L1 UI 元件 | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ | ✅ |
| L2 業務元件 | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| bug fix | ❌ | 視情況 | ✅ | ✅ |
| breaking refactor | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |

